# Reloading (T2): `reload` re-reads the content last loaded, replays this session's commands
# on it, and says what changed. Edit a file in the loaded directory between commands to try
# it. If the content no longer loads, or a command comes out differently, nothing changes.
# From the shell, `factional compare <scenario> --content A --against B` runs a whole scenario
# on two worlds instead.

load content/sample
act player steal --target merchant_ava
watch player
# Nothing was edited, so the replay comes out the same.
reload
assert standing player == merchant_ava: -20.00
assert time == tick 0
journal
